---
import BaseLayout from "../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Modern America & Innovation" description="Explore modern American life, science, technology, business, inventions, automotive history, and the people shaping the United States today.">
  <section class="modern-hero"><div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">SOCIETY · SCIENCE · TECHNOLOGY · INNOVATION</p>
    <h1>Modern America & Innovation</h1>
    <p class="lead">Discover the United States as it is today: how Americans live and work, how ideas become inventions, how companies shape the world, and how science and technology influence everyday life.</p>
    <p class="translation">Современная Америка: общество, повседневная жизнь, наука, технологии, бизнес, изобретения и люди, меняющие мир.</p>
  </div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container modern-content">
    <a class="back-link" href="/american-english-method/">← Home</a>
    <p class="intro">Understanding a country means looking beyond its history and famous landmarks. It also means exploring the lives of ordinary people, the institutions and industries around them, the ideas they debate, and the innovations that affect the wider world. This section offers a balanced, accessible introduction to the United States today.</p>
    <p class="translation">Чтобы понять страну, важно увидеть не только её прошлое, но и настоящее: повседневную жизнь людей, общественные институты, экономику, научные достижения и современные перемены.</p>

    <div class="topic-grid">
      <article><span class="number">01 / EVERYDAY LIFE</span><h2>Everyday Life in America</h2><p>Explore family life, work, education, housing, healthcare, shopping, transport, food, holidays, and daily routines across different communities and regions.</p><p class="ru">Семья, работа, образование, жильё, медицина, покупки, транспорт, питание и повседневные привычки.</p></article>
      <article><span class="number">02 / SOCIETY & VALUES</span><h2>American Society & Mindset</h2><p>Understand social norms, communication styles, privacy, personal space, individualism, volunteering, community life, and the diversity of American experiences. Avoid stereotypes: there is no single way to be American.</p><p class="ru">Общественные нормы, стиль общения, личные границы, индивидуализм, волонтёрство и разнообразие взглядов.</p></article>
      <article><span class="number">03 / SCIENCE & DISCOVERY</span><h2>American Science & Discoveries</h2><p>Meet researchers and explore contributions in medicine, physics, computing, engineering, space exploration, environmental science, and other fields. Separate established findings from emerging research.</p><p class="ru">Медицина, физика, вычислительная техника, инженерия, космос и экологические исследования.</p></article>
      <article><span class="number">04 / PEOPLE & IDEAS</span><h2>Great Americans & Inventors</h2><p>Discover the lives and work of scientists, inventors, engineers, entrepreneurs, educators, explorers, and public figures — including the teams and collaborators behind major achievements.</p><p class="ru">Учёные, изобретатели, инженеры, предприниматели, исследователи и люди, повлиявшие на развитие страны.</p></article>
      <article><span class="number">05 / BUSINESS & INDUSTRY</span><h2>American Companies & Industry</h2><p>Explore companies and industries with global influence, from computing and aerospace to manufacturing, entertainment, retail, and energy. Learn how businesses grow, compete, and affect society.</p><p class="ru">Технологии, авиация и космос, производство, развлечения, торговля и энергетика.</p></article>
      <article><span class="number">06 / AUTOMOTIVE CULTURE</span><h2>The American Automotive Story</h2><p>From the Model T and the rise of mass production to muscle cars, pickups, SUVs, motorsports, and electric vehicles. Explore the companies, engineering, design, and culture behind American cars.</p><p class="ru">От Ford Model T и массового производства до muscle cars, пикапов, внедорожников и электромобилей.</p></article>
      <article><span class="number">07 / TECHNOLOGY & THE FUTURE</span><h2>Technology & the Digital Age</h2><p>Understand the development and influence of the internet, software, artificial intelligence, smartphones, robotics, cybersecurity, and emerging technologies.</p><p class="ru">Интернет, программное обеспечение, искусственный интеллект, смартфоны, робототехника и новые технологии.</p></article>
      <article><span class="number">08 / PLACES & LANDMARKS</span><h2>American Places & Landmarks</h2><p>Explore the states, regions, cities, national parks, infrastructure, and landmarks that reveal the scale and variety of the United States.</p><p class="ru">Штаты, регионы, города, национальные парки, инфраструктура и достопримечательности.</p></article>
      <article><span class="number">09 / SPORTS & ENTERTAINMENT</span><h2>Sports & Entertainment</h2><p>Get to know baseball, American football, basketball, hockey, major sporting traditions, television, cinema, and the entertainment industry.</p><p class="ru">Бейсбол, американский футбол, баскетбол, хоккей, телевидение, кино и индустрия развлечений.</p></article>
    </div>

    <section class="editorial-section">
      <p class="eyebrow">A CLOSER LOOK AT REAL LIFE</p>
      <h2>More than success stories</h2>
      <p>Modern America is dynamic and diverse, but it also faces serious questions and challenges. Our articles will examine achievements alongside limitations, public debates, economic pressures, regional differences, and social problems. We will distinguish facts, informed analysis, and personal viewpoints, and provide sources for readers who want to explore further.</p>
      <p class="ru">Мы будем рассказывать не только об успехах, но и о трудностях и противоречиях современной Америки. Важно видеть реальную картину, а не рекламный образ страны.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="learning-box">
      <p class="eyebrow">LEARN ENGLISH THROUGH THE REAL WORLD</p>
      <h2>Understand America. Build your English.</h2>
      <p>Each feature will combine an accessible English article with Russian-language support, useful vocabulary in context, natural American expressions, photographs or other visual sources, and questions for discussion. Audio will be added when available.</p>
      <p class="ru">Каждая публикация объединит доступный английский текст, русский перевод, полезную лексику, живые американские выражения, наглядные материалы и вопросы для обсуждения. По мере готовности будем добавлять аудио.</p>
      <div class="learning-steps"><span>Read</span><span>Understand</span><span>Explore vocabulary</span><span>Discuss</span></div>
    </section>
    <p class="source-note">Articles will use reliable and, where possible, primary sources such as government agencies, universities, research institutions, museums, company histories, and established publications. Dates, statistics, and claims will be checked and identified in individual features.</p>
    <div class="related-links"><a href="/american-english-method/learn/history-heritage/">American History & Heritage ↗</a><a href="/american-english-method/learn/culture-arts/">American Culture & Arts ↗</a></div>
  </div></section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
.modern-hero{padding:78px 0 84px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#0d1929,#1b304a);color:#fffefa}
.modern-hero .container,.modern-content{max-width:1040px}
.eyebrow{color:#c5a267;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.18em}
h1{margin:18px 0;font:600 clamp(40px,6vw,64px)/1.1 "Playfair Display",serif}
.lead{max-width:880px;color:#e0e4e9;font-size:20px;line-height:1.7}
.translation,.ru{color:#89929d;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7}
.modern-hero .translation{color:#c5cdd6}
.modern-content{padding-top:34px;padding-bottom:80px}
.intro{max-width:920px;margin-top:30px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.8;color:#26364a}
.topic-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:15px;margin-top:36px}
.topic-grid article{padding:25px;border:1px solid #e2ded5;background:#fffefa}
.number{color:#b89552;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.14em}
.topic-grid h2{margin:12px 0;color:#172538;font:600 24px "Playfair Display",serif}
.topic-grid p,.editorial-section p{color:#465363;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75}
.topic-grid .ru,.editorial-section .ru{color:#89929d}
.editorial-section{margin-top:72px;padding:30px;border-left:3px solid #b89552;background:#f4f1eb}
.editorial-section h2,.learning-box h2{margin:12px 0 16px;color:#172538;font:600 clamp(30px,4vw,38px)/1.2 "Playfair Display",serif}
.learning-box{margin-top:60px;padding:34px;background:#0d1929;color:#fffefa}
.learning-box h2{color:#fffefa}
.learning-box>p:not(.eyebrow){max-width:900px;color:#d7dce2;line-height:1.8}
.learning-box .ru{color:#c5cdd6}
.learning-steps{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:24px}
.learning-steps span{padding:9px 13px;border:1px solid rgba(232,220,193,.4);color:#e8dcc1;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase}
.source-note{margin-top:26px;color:#89929d;font-size:12px;line-height:1.7}
.related-links{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:20px;margin-top:24px}
.related-links a{color:#8b6b32;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase}
@media(max-width:700px){.topic-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.modern-hero{padding:58px 0}.editorial-section{padding:23px}.learning-box{padding:24px}}
</style>
